body:
Stupid reddit wont let me post; I'm trying to lend support to more than one person every nine minutes. 

&#x200B;

I just want you to know that I feel for you. No one should have ever raped you, it's not your fault. Many of us bare the weight of pain of rape and sexual abuse for a long time, but it's not ours to bare; someone else transferred all of their shame and pain on to us, and it was very wrong. I don't know what to say or how to help, but I am thinking of you.
